SUMMARY:AYPROS August Pub Club: DSSOLVR
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n# **AYPROS August Pub 
 Club: DSSOLVR**\n\nThere may not be a more appropriately Asheville place f
 or an August Pub Club than DSSOLVR.\n\nJoin AYPROS on **Tuesday\, August 2
 5** as we take over a corner of DSSOLVR’s downtown Asheville taproom for
  an easy summer evening with Asheville’s young professional community.\n
 Known for its decidedly offbeat personality\, creative brews\, and anythin
 g-but-ordinary taproom\, DSSOLVR feels like a natural fit for Pub Club. Wh
 ether you have been coming to AYPROS events for years or this will be your
  first one\, this is an easy place to show up\, grab a drink\, and meet so
 me new people.\n\nPub Club is intentionally casual. Leave the business car
 ds at home\, come as you are\, and forget about having an agenda. There is
  no formal program\, no speeches\, and no expectation that you work the ro
 om. Just find us\, grab a drink\, catch up with familiar faces\, introduce
  yourself to someone new\, and enjoy the evening.\n\nWe will be there from
  **5:00 PM - 8:00 PM**\, but Pub Club is always come-and-go. Arrive when y
 ou can and stay as long as you would like.\n\nYour **first drink is on us*
 *\, courtesy of our Pub Club Title Sponsor\, **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (AS
 K Law)**.\n\nDSSOLVR offers far more than beer\, with a rotating selection
  that includes lagers\, IPAs\, sours and other creative brews\, along with
  wine\, cider\, mead and nonalcoholic options. Food is also available from
  the DSSOLVR kitchen for purchase.\n\n## What to Expect\n\n* A relaxed\, c
 ome-and-go evening in downtown Asheville\n* Your first drink included cour
 tesy of ASK Law\n* Additional beverages and food available for purchase\n*
  Plenty of time to catch up with friends and meet other young professional
 s\n* New attendees and people coming on their own are absolutely welcome\n
 * No formal program or speeches\n\n## Schedule\n\n**5:00 PM** \\- Check\\-
 in opens\\\, first drinks and Pub Club begins\n**8:00 PM** \\- AYPROS Pub 
 Club concludes\n\n## Location\n\n**DSSOLVR**\n63 N. Lexington Avenue\nAshe
 ville\, NC 28801\n\n## Parking\n\nDSSOLVR is located in downtown Asheville
 \, so please allow a few extra minutes for parking.\nStreet parking and pu
 blic parking garages are available throughout downtown. The **Rankin Avenu
 e Garage at 12 Rankin Avenue** is a nearby City of Asheville parking optio
 n.\nCome when you can\, stay as long as you would like\, and spend a summe
 r evening with some good people in one of downtown Asheville’s most unmi
 stakably Asheville taprooms.\n\nA special thank you to **DSSOLVR** for wel
 coming AYPROS and to **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law)** for continuing 
 to make Pub Club possible by sponsoring everyone’s first drink.\nWe can
 ’t wait to see you there.
